# Elements: with STRIKE up (B3 page) B1 PLAY strikes the resonator, and a J3
# gate does the same; it rings, then decays.
wait 3500
silence
press b3                   # the exciter page while held
wait 200
pot 3 0.0                  # STRIKE: sweep through its stored value to catch it
wait 100
pot 3 0.5
wait 100
pot 3 0.9
wait 100
pot 6 0.0
wait 100
pot 6 0.6                  # MALLET
wait 200
release b3
wait 500
mark
hold b1 400
wait 300
expect rms > 0.002         # struck
wait 4000
mark
wait 500
print rms
mark
cv 3 5                     # J3 gate
wait 400
cv 3 0
wait 300
expect rms > 0.002
expect finite
